      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that but i feel fine otherwise, just tired. the swelling isnt even that bad, it just feels like a heavy muscle ache or something. i took some ibuprofen and a bunch of electrolytes earlier which helped a bit. do you really think i need to rush to the hospital for just a sore leg and being out of breath after a long flight? seems like a lot of drama for jet lag isn't it?",
